This derivative adds style selection, the design-sharing editorial preset,
the minimal-showcase preset, title-aware emoji selection, article covers,
continuous social-media cards and offline per-platform creator profiles. It does not imply upstream endorsement.

This product is licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Showcase images in docs/showcase/ are examples, not reusable creator profiles.
gallery.png and gallery-4x3.png come from the upstream oil-cover repository
and are credited to @oil-oil. design-share-*.png are LSF design-sharing examples
published by the derivative maintainer. astra-flowers-*.png are additional LSF
design-sharing examples based on the maintainer's video:
https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/6aacae260000000011037fdc
The Astra sticker references the icon on the official OpenAI model page:
https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-astra
minimal-showcase-*.png are LSF minimal-showcase examples of the same video,
showing floating MacBook mockups, topic-based gradients and title-aware emoji.
